      "writtenOn": "2023-11-15T18:06:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "AT+%QAC needs to be responded with +%QAC(this is sent from bta_ag_swb_handle_vs_at_events), followed by OK.\n\nWhere as AT+%QCS is a response to +%QCS sent from AG. Only OK needs to be sent to BT headset for this. Hence the order of bta_ag_swb_handle_vs_at_events() and bta_ag_send_ok() are different for both of these commands.",
